              "content": "The same shell with the settings surface open. It is a modal dialog — not a page — sized xl at 80vh, holding a 260px resizable nav on the left and the panel on the right. There is no dialog header and no footer: the only chrome is a floating close button. Runtime is selected, so the panel shows the global concurrency field over the project-scoped model and harness defaults.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
              "fontSize": 16,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
